execute in fixed order v0, v1, v2, so variant is perfectly confounded with how
hot the phone is -- every variant is measured on a hotter device than the one
before it. The long job cooks, the short job doesn't, which is why
job_terminating trends the other way (193.5 for the last-run variant: governor
ramp-up, same confound, opposite sign). Position effects dominate the compiler
effect on this device in both directions.

