reverse order for half the reps, or simply add a second pass v2, v1, v0. If the
pattern follows the *variant* it is real; if it follows the *position* it is
heat. Nothing else in the harness needs to change. A sleep between variants is
the lazier version and it costs a cool-down you cannot verify happened; the
reversal is self-evidencing.

