      and it is the one that has to fit VTCM.
  3'. CPU i8mm/SDOT kernel at B=64 on the phone. This is the honest baseline
      the NPU has to beat, it is ~40 lines, and it needs no Hexagon SDK. Until
      it exists, "the NPU earns its place" has no denominator.
  4'. Then AGENT-3's #3 (VTCM residency) — and check HVX popcount width first,
