### The three "exists nowhere" wedges, scored against current evidence

**1. Phone-NPU runtime — contradicted by measurement.**
S18: memory-bound at q=1. AGENT-3's ggml-hexagon table on this exact
silicon: decode CPU 22.0 t/s, NPU 18.8 t/s — the NPU is *worse*.
