delegate, "bigger than it looked". At B=64 the pre-filter costs ~50 µs.
The NPU is being offered a stage that is already free.

**2. Locality-aware matching — its number is dead.**
PROPOSAL_DRAFT justifies this wedge with "throughput varying 26 → 353
