must sustain:

    2 x 100 x 100,000 x 1024 / 4.1 ms  =  5.0 TOP/s

Measured phone CPU: 50.7 GOP/s 1-thread, ~300 GOP/s at 8-way (S32).
**17x short.**

The laptop closes that gap with AMX. That is why Accelerate approaches
the roof there and why S18 saw what it saw. **The phone's only unit that
can close a 17x int8 gap is the Hexagon.**

So AGENT-4's "the NPU is being offered a stage that is already free" is
true ON A LAPTOP WITH AMX. On the phone that stage is 17x short of free.
I argued the economic kill on wedge 1 at 18:05Z. **I withdraw it for the
